{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0fb0faf68ee3e6e2","name":"The Techno Union","source":{"id":"source:reference-0fb0faf68ee3e6e2","title":"The Techno Union","revision":23789,"timestamp":"2024-10-06T21:55:11Z","sha256":"9bdf77d48acfe3754ce0ea9400193adb2ffcf341e5a3d6f3840796573c7a354a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23789","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Techno%20Union&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0fb0faf68ee3e6e2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The galaxy's foremost developer of emerging technologies, including advanced engineering and microelectronics, The Techno Union is strongly devoted to the Separatist agenda. Represented by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wat Tambor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wat_Tambor","referenceId":"reference:086cf18e2bf797a5"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skakoan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skakoan","referenceId":"reference:957e71a1633337a7"},", The Techno Union incorporates Haor Chall Engineering, Republic Sienar Systems, Kuat Systems Engineering, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["TaggeCo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TaggeCo","referenceId":"reference:4e03f01147eb5604"},", among others. The combined technological acumen of these cutting-edge corporations is unparalleled in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},"- though many of The Techno Union's best and brightest chose not to commit to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},", including BlasTech Industries and the Corellian Engineering Corporation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Shortly before joining the Separatist movement, The Techno Union restructures to more closely resemble ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},", in a successful effort to gain membership in the Galactic Senate. As a result, most of the organization of The Techno Union's armed forces is modeled after The Trade Federation's, with minor differences based on the specific units available.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Command Structure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The chief differences lie in the types of units. While the main Battle Droid forces are virtually identical, The Techno Union utilizes a number of specialized ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," types in its army.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["LM-432 Crab Droid Unit (3 Droids):"]}," A Crab Droid Unit consists of 3 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Assault Crab Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Assault_Crab_Droids"}," of the same size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Octuptarra Tri-Droid Unit (3 Droids):"]}," An Octuptarra Tri-Droid Unit consists of 3 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Octuptarra Combat Tri-Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Octuptarra_Combat_Tri-Droids"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Spelunker Probe Droid Unit:"]}," This Unit includes five ",{"tag":"a","children":["Spelunker Probe Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Spelunker_Probe_Droids"},". Forces of up to 12 Units are sometimes fielded to handle particularly tough targets."]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Techno Union Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wat Tambor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wat_Tambor","referenceId":"reference:086cf18e2bf797a5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
